    "  progression axis",
    "    - pg-1-1 rough ore yield 1.4 -> 1.6           (changed)",
    "    - warden-insight-2 gold cost 20000 -> 18000   (changed)",
    "    - pg-event-1 gone, the event ended            (removed)",
    "    - pg-3-1 and sigil-radiant                    (added)",
    "    - pg-3-1's drops carry sampledRuns, which 1.0's do not: this is the",
    "      only fixture drop measured rather than declared, and it is here so",
    "      the field survives the writer, the parser and the schema. 1.0 stays",
    "      entirely declared so the acceptance plans remain hand-checkable.",
    "  catalog axis",
    "    - warden-strike rank 2 damage 1.32 -> 1.28    (changed)",
    "    - warden atk at tier 1 level 40 415 -> 430    (changed)",
    "",
    "A balance patch that moves a skill multiplier without touching a single",
    "material cost is the case that makes both axes worth versioning together.",
    "This bundle is that patch and the one below it at the same time."
